WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your back and bend both knees toward the chest.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Hold the shins or behind the thighs and draw the knees gently in.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Keep the head and shoulders heavy on the floor.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Rock side to side if it feels good, massaging the lower back.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Release the feet to the floor when ready.
